# New Feature: ${input:featureName:Feature name (e.g. user-auth, billing, notifications)}

Create a complete, working implementation of the **${input:featureName}** feature for the `{{ project_name }}` project.
{% if cli_support != "none" %}
If the feature exposes a CLI command, add it under `src/{{ pkg_name }}/commands/` and register it in `__main__.py`.
{% endif %}
{% if db_driver != "none" %}
If the feature requires a new database table, create:
- `database/migrations/<next_number>_${input:featureName}.up.sql`
- `database/migrations/<next_number>_${input:featureName}.down.sql`

Follow the existing migration file naming convention.
{% endif %}
{% if testing_frameworks %}
Add tests in `tests/` covering:
- Happy path
- Key error paths and edge cases
{% endif %}

